  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lupanda Bean Production Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to build the cooperative s capacities in financial and operationalmanagement; as well as the farming skills and practices of members; in order to address the constraints to production. Farmers receive extension support services; and access to affordable key inputs like fertilizers; pesticides; and high quality seeds.</narrative>
  </description>
